  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The oxyacid&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>HPO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;has different structures based on the value of n. If n=3,&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cadd368d-44df-4eac-87c6-19ce5b2c69e4-image.png\" style=\"width: 181px; height: 162px;\" /></p><p>The oxyacid&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;has the following structure.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/47bc6c94-2518-4481-bfb4-082ea00292a7-9893514.PNG\" style=\"width: 237px; height: 129px;\" /></p><p>The structures of the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/959a3782-fa9b-47ba-900a-fa872e4eb05b-image.png\" style=\"width: 394px; height: 107px;\" /></p><p>Oxyacid having <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> bond can reduce <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;to<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ag</mi></math>. Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;can create silver mirror with silver nitrate.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
